        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二、中国新闻史</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", SimHei, sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 14px 16px 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1.doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #c00000;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  table.main {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  table.main th, table.main td {\n    border: 1px solid #b5b5b5;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n  table.main thead th {\n    border-top: 2px solid #444;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #444;\n    border-left: none;\n    border-right: none;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 12px 6px;\n  }\n  table.main thead tr th:not(:last-child) {\n    border-right: 1px solid #b5b5b5;\n  }\n  col.c1 { width: 22%; }\n  col.c2 { width: 24%; }\n  col.c3 { width: 28%; }\n  col.c4 { width: 26%; }\n  td.lv1 {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n  }\n  td.lv2 {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  td.lv3 {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  td.remark {\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  td.dash {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    display: block;\n    text-indent: 1em;\n  }\n  .thick-top {\n    border-top: 2px solid #444 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"doc-title\">二、中国新闻史</h1>\n\n  <table class=\"main\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col class=\"c1\">\n      <col class=\"c2\">\n      <col class=\"c3\">\n      <col class=\"c4\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>一级考点</th>\n        <th>二级考点</th>\n        <th>三级考点</th>\n        <th>备注</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv1\" rowspan=\"3\">1.中国古代的<br>新闻传播活动</td>\n        <td class=\"lv2\">（1）我国最早的报纸——唐朝的官报</td>\n        <td class=\"lv3\">①《敦煌进奏院状》<br>②唐代报纸特点</td>\n        <td class=\"remark\" rowspan=\"3\">除了以上的重点，很多院校还会去着重考察宋代的小报以及小报的特点，大家可以对照自己院校的考纲和真题，做增删。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv2\">（2）定本制度</td>\n        <td class=\"dash\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv2\">（3）明清的官报和《京报》</td>\n        <td class=\"lv3\">—</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv1 thick-top\" rowspan=\"4\">2.近代报业的<br>产生和初步发展</td>\n        <td class=\"lv2 thick-top\">（1）第一批中文近代报刊</td>\n        <td class=\"lv3 thick-top\">①《察世俗每月统记传》<br>②《东西洋考每月统记传》<br>③第一批中文近代报刊特点与意义</td>\n        <td class=\"remark thick-top\" rowspan=\"4\">如果院校不考查名词解释，就可以对上面几点进行简单的了解，重点掌握外人在华办报的分析与评价；但是如果院校重点会考察一些名字解释和简答的话，前三点是大家要要掌握的重点哦。</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv2\">（2）鸦片战争后外国人办报主要报纸</td>\n        <td class=\"lv3\">①《字林西报》<br>②《万国公报》</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv2\">（3）《申报》和中文商业性报刊的兴起和发展</td>\n        <td class=\"lv3\">①《上海新报》<br>②《申报》：名词解释、简答和论述</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"lv2\">（4）对外国人在华办报的分析与评价</td>\n        <td class=\"lv3\">①外报垄断是殖民主义者的侵略行为<br>②外报在客观上促进了中西文化交流<br>③外报办报实践有助于我国报业发展</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
